 /*
- * Read-only probes.  PSCI_FEATURES(0xC4000012) is the architectural answer to
- * "can this firmware do SYSTEM_RESET2"; 0 means not supported, 1 supported,
- * 2 invalid parameter, negative a PSCI error.
+ * Read-only probes.  The first answer is the negative control: PSCI_FEATURES
